s begins to slow.  A series of hairline cracks radiate from a single point in space, hanging in midair as if reality was struck with an immense hammer.  Radiant purple and black light shines through the shattered nothingness, and you feel normalcy reassert itself around the edges.  From the void, a discordant song of mirth can be heard.","The air takes on a crystalline quality here, and the flow of the waters begins to slow.  A series of hairline cracks radiate from a single point in space, hanging in midair.","The current is weaker here, the waters thicker.  Occasional masses of rancid fat burble to the surface, breaking apart and combining listlessly.  The howling remains of Maelshyve seem to be imperceptibly diminishing, while on the other side of the vortex grotesque hordes clamor with unmistakable malevolence, waiting.","The current is weaker here, the waters thicker.  Occasional masses of rancid fat burble to the surface, breaking apart and combining listlessly.","The ebb and flow of the noxious tide thunders throughout the void, irregular like a sickly heartbeat.  Nearby a floating, shredded tentacle piece bobs in own little eddy, somehow managing to stay relatively still despite the currents.","The ebb and flow of the noxious tide thunders throughout the void, irregular like a sickly heartbeat.","The rushing waters feel almost intangible here, their mass diminished.  Echoes spiral through your mind, a creeping whisper that seems to come from Maelshyve's core, a needling itch that slides over your awareness, probing and testing.  From the other direction, endless cackling from a wall of malevolence, howling in anticipation.","The rushing waters feel almost intangible here, their mass diminished.  Echoes spiral through your mind, a needling itch that slides over your awareness, probing and testing.","The rushing, crashing fluid is lit with blood-red luminance from beneath, where small reptilian shadows dart to and fro in their deranged haste to flee you -- or 