  {"id":29,"x":280,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Soul of Maelshyve, The Pith","descriptions":["A subsonic rumble vibrates your teeth, and the water dances with interference ripples, spikes and valleys skittering along the surface in overlapping waves sweeping outward from Maelshyve's core.  Nearly buried under the din, you are able to make out a woman's endless, primal scream of terror and rage.  The deafening sound is swallowed by the void, the denizens of which seem strangely silent, for once.","A subsonic rumble vibrates your teeth, and the water dances with interference ripples, spikes and valleys skittering along the surface in overlapping waves.","Brown and black curls of filthy water wind around you, eddies mixing in long comets of grime.  To one side of the water, the suffering core of Maelshyve whimpers pitifully, and to the other side, a wall of eyes follows your every movement.","Brown and black curls of filthy water wind around you, eddies mixing in long comets of grime.","Bubbling violently, the water is almost scaldingly hot here, plumes of vile-smelling steam filling the air.  The corpses of strange pale creatures float by, parboiled alive, and the fetid humidity masks shifting forms.  Though you can barely see Maelshyve's core, you can feel the heat radiating off it.  Out in the void, iridescent insect-like creatures spread articulated wings and bask in the heat.","Bubbling, the water is almost scaldingly hot here, plumes of vile-smelling steam filling the air.  The parboiled corpses of strange pale creatures float by.","Extending from the core of Maelshyve, an inky black tendril probes the waters here, buffeted by the current.  On the other side of the gyre, an uncanny presence waits, flexing and stretching its many claws.","Extending from the core of Maelshyve, an inky black tendril probes the waters here.  On the other side of the gyre, an uncanny presence waits.","Intermittently, the dusky sludge erupts into columns that rise overhead, bending toward the whirlpool's odious core.  Flowing along its own localized rules, the sludge forms watery arches that evaporate into fine mist as they arc inward.","Intermittently, the dusky sludge erupts into columns that rise overhead.  Flowing along its own localized rules, the sludge forms watery arches that soon evaporate into fine mist.","Knots of willowy black hair cling to your legs, dragged along by the current.  The water is choked with the stuff, strands collecting in chaotic braids that seem to writhe of their own volition.  Maelshyve's core swirls in outrage, and beyond the vortex, the sound of metal drawn across metal rings in the depths.","Knots of willowy black hair cling to your legs, dragged along by the current.  The water is choked with the stuff, strands collecting in writhing braids.","Murky water carrying assorted flotsam swirls by -- rotting branches, pieces of bone, and fist-sized scales all bobbing in the dark liquid.  To one side, the remains of Maelshyve radiate agony and suffering, and to the other side, an endless expanse of cosmos writhe with eye and claw.","Murky water carrying assorted flotsam swirls by -- rotting branches, pieces of bone, and fist-sized scales all bobbing in the dark liquid.","Small blobs of coagulated fat drift by, the surface of the water oil-slick with rainbow sheen.  Maelshyve's substance churns with activity, sending out thick ropy protrusions that melt and collapse, splashing loudly onto the rapids in a futile attempt to reach into the endless void beyond the vortex.","Small blobs of coagulated fat drift by, the surface of the water oil-slick with rainbow sheen.","Surging in confused waves, the muck here is polluted even further by what look like sheets of gangrenous pus, broken free from the core and caught in the everlasting whirl around it.","Surging in confused waves, the muck here is polluted even further by what look like sheets of gangrenous pus.","The air takes on a crystalline quality here, and the flow of the waters begins to slow.  A series of hairline cracks radiate from a single point in space, hanging in midair as if reality was struck with an immense hammer.  Radiant purple and black light shines through the shattered nothingness, and you feel normalcy reassert itself around the edges.  From the void, a discordant song of mirth can be heard.","The air takes on a crystalline quality here, and the flow of the waters begins to slow.  A series of hairline cracks radiate from a single point in space, hanging in midair.","The current is weaker here, the waters thicker.  Occasional masses of rancid fat burble to the surface, breaking apart and combining listlessly.  The howling remains of Maelshyve seem to be imperceptibly diminishing, while on the other side of the vortex grotesque hordes clamor with unmistakable malevolence, waiting.","The current is weaker here, the waters thicker.  Occasional masses of rancid fat burble to the surface, breaking apart and combining listlessly.","The ebb and flow of the noxious tide thunders throughout the void, irregular like a sickly heartbeat.  Nearby a floating, shredded tentacle piece bobs in own little eddy, somehow managing to stay relatively still despite the currents.","The ebb and flow of the noxious tide thunders throughout the void, irregular like a sickly heartbeat.","The rushing waters feel almost intangible here, their mass diminished.  Echoes spiral through your mind, a creeping whisper that seems to come from Maelshyve's core, a needling itch that slides over your awareness, probing and testing.  From the other direction, endless cackling from a wall of malevolence, howling in anticipation.","The rushing waters feel almost intangible here, their mass diminished.  Echoes spiral through your mind, a needling itch that slides over your awareness, probing and testing.","The rushing, crashing fluid is lit with blood-red luminance from beneath, where small reptilian shadows dart to and fro in their deranged haste to flee you -- or something else.  They strive against the inward current but seem reluctant to go too far in the opposite direction.","The rushing, crashing fluid is lit with blood-red luminance from beneath, where small reptilian shadows dart to and fro in their deranged haste to flee you -- or something else.","The water is colder here, and small chunks of black ice drift by, embedded with strange toothy creatures imprisoned in fist-sized slurries that tumble and break apart as they melt.  Rime glitters on this side of the core of Maelshyve, swirling with black snow.  Across the churning waters, a multitude of tongues flicker over row upon row of teeth.","The water is colder here, and small chunks of black ice drift by, embedded with strange toothy creatures imprisoned in fist-sized slurries that tumble and break apart as they melt.","Thick fluid rushes around you, cold and stinking of decay.  Nearby, the dying core of Maelshyve occasionally shudders, and in the opposite direction, a fathomless inky blackness seems to skitter under your gaze.","Thick fluid rushes around you, cold and stinking of decay.","Whorls of liquid silver and bluish sludge buoy upon a tide of boiling mud and slime, never quite mixing but seeming drawn together nevertheless.  Burbling with deathly fumes and bubbles, the whole turmoil flows alternately toward the core and away from it.","Whorls of liquid silver and bluish sludge buoy upon a tide of boiling mud and slime, never quite mixing but seeming drawn together nevertheless."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"southeast","move":"swim southeast"},{"to":30,"exit":"west","move":"swim west"}],"color":"#0000FF"},
