  {"id":47,"x":100,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"A Treacherous Silver Liquid","descriptions":["You struggle to make sense of the images and entities rushing past, and the sheath of reality protecting you from the encroaching madness feels horrifyingly delicate.  It is clear that wherever you are, you are the interloper here."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":48,"x":260,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Abyss","descriptions":["You struggle to make sense of the images and entities rushing past, and the sheath of reality protecting you from the encroaching madness feels horrifyingly delicate.  It is clear that wherever you are, you are the interloper here."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":49,"x":240,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Outside the Interval","descriptions":["You stand between memory and the present, moments before the notion of gravity and the rules of reality.  Blurred moments of cosmic events that you are sure you could not have witnessed merge into familiar experiences you cannot recall as your own.  Here, the directives of the Plane of Abiding conflict with the Plane of Exile, both yielding to Maelshyve's will."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":50,"x":320,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Outside the Pith","descriptions":["Maelshyve's fractured ego stretches to an endless point, reality embracing her singular motive: worship.  What passes for air in this usurped space sings with singular focus for exaltation.  Reverberating paeans to her glory echo around you, as endless lines of robed supplicants bring gifts of fealty and flesh.  She squeezes a constellation until it drips with blood -- the force of her will is unbearable, and you are struck with an almost irresistible impulse to kneel and commit yourself in her name."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":51,"x":180,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Plane of Exile","descriptions":["Vague distortions to the amorphous monochromatic backdrop prevent any sense of distance or scale, and there is only the choking haze filled with fathomless appetites."],"exits":[]},
  {"id":52,"x":100,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Maelshyve's Fortress, Inner Sanctum","descriptions":["A wave of mysterious silver liquid flows sluggishly like streaming teardrops from a crack in the ceiling, painting the eastern wall in its luminescence.  The liquid disappears into another crack in the ground, presumably to an unknown reservoir.  Strange shapes manifest in the mirrored liquid every so often, only to smooth out moments later.","A wave of mysterious silver liquid flows sluggishly like streaming teardrops from a crack in the ceiling, painting the eastern wall in its luminescence."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go silver liquid"}],"aliases":["Maelshyve's Fortress","Therengia"],"linksTo":"Map31b_Maelshyve's_Fortress.xml"},
  {"id":53,"x":260,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Abyssal Nether, Maelshyve's Remnant","descriptions":["The coiling helix of fused bone ends here, dropping off into the abyss.  Cradled in the clawlike comfort of the path's edge is a great black shell, cracked open like an egg.  From within, an endless river of midnight-blue sludge pours out, streaming into the endless darkness below.","Cradled in the clawlike comfort of the path's edge is a great black shell, cracked open like an egg.  From within, an endless river of midnight-blue sludge pours out, streaming into the endless darkness below."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":"go midnight-blue sludge"}],"aliases":["Abyss","Ilithi","Southern Trade Route","STR"],"linksTo":"Map66_STR3.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": [
